# env files — local / build-time config, never committed.
# `.env.example` files are allowed so the available variables are
# documented in the repo without leaking values. The `!.env/` line
# un-ignores any directory literally named `.env` (we keep env files
# under `apps/demo/src/.env/`); file-level patterns below still ignore
# the contents.
.env
.env.*
!.env/
!.env.example
